== Advanced ToB Strategies ==
Non-exhaustive strategies at Theatre of Blood bosses for those wanting to push their gameplay and get into more efficient ToB. Much of this information is copy-pasted from GM30, Max eff moneys, Flash's Hideout, and We Do Raids. 
It is highly recommended you are familiar with [[game ticks]], [[attack speed]], and [[true tile]] to become fully comfortable with these methods.

'''General Tips'''
* Always [[super combat potion|potted]], all the time. If you are brewed down, pot back up. If you are drained, pot.
* 100% thrall uptime.
* Take your Venges. If possible, take them off-prayer for more damage.
* Eat hardfood when attack cooldown is negligible e.g. Verzik P1 -> P2 or Sote maze. If emergency healing, combo eat, then [[Guide:Advanced_Theatre_of_Blood#How_to_Brew+Supercombat_Pot_(BSCP)|BSCP]]
* If you are at the gate, it is presumed you are ready, and vice-versa. Spam click it to enter on-tick with everyone else.
* Standard order is SFRZ, MFRZ, RDPS, MDPS 1, MDPS 2. In smaller scales, remove MDPS 2 first, then MFRZ. In duos, split as Ranger/Mager. In solos, good luck.

